{"title":"꽃이 되어줘","artist":"녹황색사회","sourceId":"reference:GQVUCaTP8tAJfL2K4e5E","sourceHash":"808a8a722620c0d05877ac103ca4f95d677e9806c76de01067128db4398ddc59","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":33613109,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":15.55,"end":20.66,"text":"陰にそっと隠れようがいいんじゃない?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":20.66,"end":25.44,"text":"蕾のような花だってあるじゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":25.44,"end":30.51,"text":"秘密にして守るのがいいんじゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":30.51,"end":35.95,"text":"誰にも邪魔されず華麗に咲いてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":35.95,"end":38.6,"text":"甘い苦いにハマんない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":38.6,"end":40.51,"text":"その判断がくだんない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":40.51,"end":45.95,"text":"気に病んで下を向かないでいて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":45.95,"end":48.32,"text":"愛に慣れちゃいない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":48.32,"end":50.81,"text":"無駄に飾らない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":50.81,"end":55.8,"text":"綺麗にされた花瓶も肥やしも何もいらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":55.8,"end":59.69,"text":"その姿が美しい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":59.69,"end":62.44,"text":"花になって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":62.44,"end":64.68,"text":"ほらニヒルに笑って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":64.68,"end":69.77,"text":"その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":69.77,"end":72.38,"text":"味見して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":72.38,"end":85.63,"text":"君の毒は私の薬って包んであげるから笑って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":85.63,"end":87.53999999999999,"text":"ねえ、会いたい会いたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":87.53999999999999,"end":95.96000000000001,"text":"その笑顔に会いたい会いたいって言えば笑ってくれるかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":95.96000000000001,"end":100.38,"text":"陰から支えるくらいはいいんじゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":100.38,"end":105.66,"text":"欲を言えばこの手で咲かせてみせたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":105.66,"end":118.31,"text":"病のように心を喰らう花枯らしてないのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":118.31,"end":130.75,"text":"光を届かずとも水を上げつづけるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":130.75,"end":133.35,"text":"いつ陰に気付いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":133.35,"end":138.37,"text":"君は素敵で自惚れでもどう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":138.37,"end":141.12,"text":"お大事に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":141.12,"end":145.88,"text":"無自覚なまま愛を蓄えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":145.88,"end":150.89,"text":"綺麗にされた花瓶も肥やしも何もいらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":150.89,"end":157.18,"text":"その姿で咲き誇れ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":157.18,"end":159.9,"text":"花になって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":159.9,"end":162.2,"text":"ほらニヒルに笑って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":162.2,"end":167.35,"text":"その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":167.35,"end":169.82999999999998,"text":"味見して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":169.82999999999998,"end":177.07,"text":"君の毒は私の薬って包んであげるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":177.07,"end":179.84,"text":"楽にして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":179.84,"end":187.33,"text":"君の闇を私の光で愛してあげるから笑って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}